    "authorAssociation": "NONE",
    "body": "Hi, \r\n\r\ni'd like to add an underline on tabs.\r\nI tried to use `MiniTablineCurrent` but i can't figure out how to use it inside `setup` .\r\n\r\nMaybe this could be a nice option to have.",
    "bodyHTML": "<p dir=\"auto\">Hi,</p>\n<p dir=\"auto\">i'd like to add an underline on tabs.<br>\nI tried to use <code class=\"notranslate\">MiniTablineCurrent</code> but i can't figure out how to use it inside <code class=\"notranslate\">setup</code> .</p>\n<p dir=\"auto\">Maybe this could be a nice option to have.</p>",
    "bodyText": "Hi,\ni'd like to add an underline on tabs.\nI tried to use MiniTablineCurrent but i can't figure out how to use it inside setup .\nMaybe this could be a nice option to have.",
    "category": {
        "createdAt": "2022-01-02T14:24:09Z",
        "description": "Ask the community for help",
        "emoji": ":pray:",
        "emojiHTML": "<div>🙏</div>",
        "id": "DIC_kwDOFoksYM4CAgqN",
        "isAnswerable": true,
        "name": "Q&A",
        "slug": "q-a",
        "updatedAt": "2022-01-02T14:24:09Z"
    },
    "closed": false,
    "closedAt": null,
    "comment_count": 1,
    "comment_data": [
        {
            "author": {
                "avatarUrl": "https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/24854248?u=d09fd974c6720eba3039db6beb2f1c1efecdb51d&v=4",
                "login": "echasnovski",
                "resourcePath": "/echasnovski",
                "url": "https://github.com/echasnovski"
            },
            "authorAssociation": "MEMBER",
            "body": "`MiniTablineCurrent` is a [highlight group](https://neovim.io/doc/user/syntax.html#highlight-groups). Use [:highlight](https://neovim.io/doc/user/syntax.html#%3Ahighlight) command to change it.\r\n\r\nTry adding this *after* loading your color scheme:\r\n```lua\r\nvim.cmd('hi MiniTablineCurrent gui=underline')\r\n```",
            "bodyHTML": "<p dir=\"auto\"><code class=\"notranslate\">MiniTablineCurrent</code> is a <a href=\"https://neovim.io/doc/user/syntax.html#highlight-groups\" rel=\"nofollow\">highlight group</a>. Use <a href=\"https://neovim.io/doc/user/syntax.html#%3Ahighlight\" rel=\"nofollow\">:highlight</a> command to change it.</p>\n<p dir=\"auto\">Try adding this <em>after</em> loading your color scheme:</p>\n<div class=\"highlight highlight-source-lua notranslate position-relative overflow-auto\" dir=\"auto\" data-snippet-clipboard-copy-content=\"vim.cmd('hi MiniTablineCurrent gui=underline')\"><pre class=\"notranslate\"><span class=\"pl-smi\">vim</span>.<span class=\"pl-c1\">cmd</span>(<span class=\"pl-s\"><span class=\"pl-pds\">'</span>hi MiniTablineCurrent gui=underline<span class=\"pl-pds\">'</span></span>)</pre></div>",
            "bodyText": "MiniTablineCurrent is a highlight group. Use :highlight command to change it.\nTry adding this after loading your color scheme:\nvim.cmd('hi MiniTablineCurrent gui=underline')",
